            Gophers Bangladesh
          </h1>
          
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
            A vibrant Go programming community in Bangladesh with hundreds of passionate Gophers. Join us for local hangouts, open source contributions, and knowledge sharing.
          </p>
